```ts
if (task.status === "done" || task.status === "cancelled") {
  throw new Error(`Task ${taskId} is already ${task.status}, nothing to release`);
}
```

This doesn't touch normal (non-cancelled) release behavior, or claim/cancel logic — verified against the existing `release_task` conflict/force/done tests, and added a regression test confirming a cancelled task now stays cancelled (with its reason intact) and isn't handed out by `get_next_task`.

